{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate branching locations, question a unique cast of characters, and make game-changing deductions.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just try not to get caught up in something<strong> <i>much bigger</i> </strong>than you bargained for\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/db4bc84398c187a1cebbdb37d4ba5f82.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/a2df907c8d299b276f85c9f2a0c96c24.poster.avif?t=1762865137\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/a2df907c8d299b276f85c9f2a0c96c24.webm?t=1762865137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/a2df907c8d299b276f85c9f2a0c96c24.mp4?t=1762865137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s 1949. </strong>Hollywood\u2019s Golden Age is at its peak. Corruption hangs over the city like smog. And disgraced detective Jack Baylor is reluctantly drawn into the case of a lifetime: tracking down budding movie starlet Ava Monroe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The investigation will take him from murky jazz clubs to glamorous mansions, and from studio backlots to the back of beyond \u2013 dragging Jack through a <i>who\u2019s who</i> of crooked politicians, dirty cops, and sleazy movie moguls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/4f158bcf7170a6fe0cd3f20f5eec29ae.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/86d17f598ee4505c5a30a80377a53b8d.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/3ef1c8b79066df8430a5b5e0398a71b3.poster.avif?t=1762865137\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/3ef1c8b79066df8430a5b5e0398a71b3.webm?t=1762865137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/3ef1c8b79066df8430a5b5e0398a71b3.mp4?t=1762865137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As each new clue slots into place, you\u2019ll cover the length and breadth of an urban jungle overflowing with interconnected locations \u2013 often with multiple choices on where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scene unlocks new characters to speak to, new puzzles to solve, and new perspectives on three key questions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What makes the city tick?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who pulls the strings?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And what drives <i>bad</i> people to do <i>worse</i> things.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/4f158bcf7170a6fe0cd3f20f5eec29ae.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/545e40c8bcf65bdecaf3d8ff0df9f219.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/9f349bd2edf3629c9e3f4203b1ff850e.poster.avif?t=1762865137\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/9f349bd2edf3629c9e3f4203b1ff850e.webm?t=1762865137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/9f349bd2edf3629c9e3f4203b1ff850e.mp4?t=1762865137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressing Jack\u2019s investigation means making intelligent deductions that drive the story forwards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By interacting with people, places and objects, you\u2019ll unlock <i><strong>DEDUCTION</strong></i> <i><strong>WORDS</strong></i> that connect the dots and help you make insightful connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate each scene thoroughly and solve its context-driven <i><strong>DEDUCTION STATEMENT</strong></i> to inch closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/4f158bcf7170a6fe0cd3f20f5eec29ae.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>15+</strong> fully voiced characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>25+</strong> noir-infused story locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Interactive puzzles</strong> and <strong>branching conversations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Detective-inspired <strong>deduction</strong> mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A gripping, twisty <strong>murder mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/4f158bcf7170a6fe0cd3f20f5eec29ae.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/640e900da0ce0ef2cf9be0ea432a9d8e.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4156380?t=1762865137","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/33a93a304d773b5c269f94ff7bb1e8e0cccc3b1b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762865137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.st