tion hangs over the city like smog. And disgraced detective Jack Baylor is reluctantly drawn into the case of a lifetime: tracking down budding movie starlet Ava Monroe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The investigation will take him from murky jazz clubs to glamorous mansions, and from studio backlots to the back of beyond \u2013 dragging Jack through a <i>who\u2019s who</i> of crooked politicians, dirty cops, and sleazy movie moguls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/4f158bcf7170a6fe0cd3f20f5eec29ae.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/86d17f598ee4505c5a30a80377a53b8d.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/3ef1c8b79066df8430a5b5e0398a71b3.poster.avif?t=1762865137\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/3ef1c8b79066df8430a5b5e0398a71b3.webm?t=1762865137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/3ef1c8b79066df8430a5b5e0398a71b3.mp4?t=1762865137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As each new clue slots into place, you\u2019ll cover the length and breadth of an urban jungle overflowing with interconnected locations \u2013 often with multiple choices on where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>