19ll unlock <i><strong>DEDUCTION</strong></i> <i><strong>WORDS</strong></i> that connect the dots and help you make insightful connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate each scene thoroughly and solve its context-driven <i><strong>DEDUCTION STATEMENT</strong></i> to inch closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/4f158bcf7170a6fe0cd3f20f5eec29ae.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>15+</strong> fully voiced characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>25+</strong> noir-infused story locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Interactive puzzles</strong> and <strong>branching conversations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Detective-inspired <strong>deduction</strong> mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A gripping, twisty <strong>murder mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/4f158bcf7170a6fe0cd3f20f5eec29ae.avif?t=1762865137\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156380/extras/64